If required select YES in Publish on Portal dropdown

The Job Portal allows (check basis) candidate to create an account for application tracking and dashboard - -  Candidate Portal

Then click on submit to raise a requisition

The system will then generate a link and QR code that can be posted on social platforms for candidates to apply online

Request can be seen in grid along with some Action button features

Job Portal

By accessing the link or QR code provided it will route on the Job Portal

The Published Job Post can be seen on the Job Portal with details entered

Candidate can apply for job simply by clicking on Start Application

To see the other job post of organization, click on Home button

The Portal shows the list of all Jon Posts

Candidate can view the details by clicking on Apply Now button or search the required Job title in the search bar

Top right of the screen share button is given that provides a QR code and link to directly access the Job portal list

Candidate Portal

If the check for Candidate Portal is ON while applying for the position the system will show a pop for login else already having an account the candidate will Sign In

The pop shows 2 options, First to Create Account Second to Continue as Guest (check basis). Applying as guest will directly route towards the application form

By clicking in Create Account, system requires brief details and email verification

Captcha is added for security and avoid data breach

Filling the details and clicking on Create Account button, system will send a verification code on the entered email

After verification the account will be created, the candidate needs to Sign In using the credentials that were defined

Candidate Sign In will route towards the Dashboard of Candidate Portal

Candidate can see all the job openings and track their application

Click on Apply Now button to fill application for position, enter the required details for the Job Post and click on Submit Application button

Application form now has ease to drag and drop files

The Dashboard will show the Job Card with details and Status, whenever candidate application will be moved in Screening the Candidate dashboard will show status and notify as well

Interview can be re-scheduled through system request (check basis)

Task Dashboard in Portal will show all the required tasks to be fulfilled by the candidate such as Document upload, Offer Accept/Reject etc.
